      "content": "Wait, I'm sorry, what do you mean by \"mischievous goblins\"? I'm looking for a scientific explanation for my thesis, so can we just stick to the chemistry please? \n\nCan you go back to the part about pH levels? I specifically need to know how alkaline versus acidic environments affect the reaction rate and the specific molecular reason why that happens.",
